# Dependency changes → documentation

When editing matched dependency paths:

1. Follow [planning/DOC-MAP.md](../../planning/DOC-MAP.md) **Dependency feature implementation checklist**.
2. If shipping a roadmap item: strike through in [planning/15-dependency-expansion-roadmap.md](../../planning/15-dependency-expansion-roadmap.md), update [planning/09-next-steps.md](../../planning/09-next-steps.md), and [README.md](../../README.md) when users gain a new mechanic or flag.
3. Invoke **`/ship-dependency-feature`** before finishing the task.

Do not merge dependency code without the corresponding planning updates in the same PR.
